This repository includes material adapted from third-party sources.

src/ccw_net/models/cwnet.py is adapted from the CW-Net class in
code_ocean_capsule/code/main.py of https://github.com/EoinKenny/CW-Net-Autonomous-Driving,
released with Kenny et al., "Explainable deep learning improves human mental models of
self-driving cars", Nature, 2026. Copyright 2026 Motional. Licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). The file was modified for this
repository. Earlier versions of that code (Code Ocean capsule 8602909) were released under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Eoin Kenny. The upstream NOTICE states: "This work was
conducted in collaboration with Motional, the Massachusetts Institute of Technology, and
Harvard University."

src/ccw_net/disentanglement_lib_compat.py implements the DCI metric after the definitions
of google-research/disentanglement_lib (Apache-2.0).

scripts/preprocess_cub.py and scripts/train_cub_backbone.py follow the concept bottleneck
setup of Koh et al. (2020), https://github.com/yewsiang/ConceptBottleneck (MIT).

The CarRacing data used by this repository come from code_ocean_capsule/data/ of the same
CW-Net release and are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
